WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.149
Speaker 1: Donald Trump will be arrested tomorrow.

00:00:03.149 --> 00:00:05.770
He will surrender in New York City.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.900
He will appear in court, presumably to enter
a plea of not guilty.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.060
At which point he is expected to leave New
York City, fly back to Florida and hold what

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:23.630
will certainly be an unhinged press conference
at Mar a Lago shortly after 8 p.m. Eastern

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:24.630
time.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.789
We're going to be covering all of it live.

00:00:25.789 --> 00:00:30.010
We will be live tomorrow with the arraignment
and we will be live tomorrow with the press

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.340
conference.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:37.010
That is essentially all I can tell you at
this time, because there are so many unknowns

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.590
at this point.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.100
One of those unknowns is whether the arraignment
will be televised.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:47.640
I'm going to separate that question out just
for a moment, because it's really its own

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.640
question.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:53.480
And we will talk a little bit about what is
to be expected tomorrow.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:01:00.070
The latest news is that Trump will fly from
Florida to New York today, Monday.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:04.449
And even though the arraignment is scheduled
for 215 tomorrow, there are reports that Trump

00:01:04.449 --> 00:01:07.400
will be at the courthouse early in the morning.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.930
Why isn't exactly clear.

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:14.759
Certainly fingerprints, potentially a mug
shot, not expected to be handcuffed based

00:01:14.759 --> 00:01:16.979
on everything we know right now.

00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:19.070
But that doesn't take that long.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:20.960
Is it because of security considerations?

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.180
Well, maybe.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:27.980
There's numerous reports that New York plans
to close key streets for Trump's arraignment.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:32.420
Patricia HURTADO from Bloomberg News reporting
that.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:38.090
And that the entire area surrounding the Manhattan
courthouse is going to be closed down to vehicle

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.090
traffic.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:44.650
It is also known that there are tunnels and
different ways to get to the main courthouse

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:46.920
building from surrounding buildings.

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:51.860
And for security reasons, presumably, Donald
Trump may be brought in through some kind

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:53.560
of secure this path.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.860
It's not exactly completely clear.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:58.960
We continue to learn more about what are the
charges.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.280
Initially, we didn't know.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.560
Then we knew that the number was over 30.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:08.780
More recently, it's it's sort of focused in
on the number 34 questions about is it all

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:09.780
misdemeanors?

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:15.390
The latest report from CBS News is that there
are felony charges here.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:21.900
So not only charges against Trump, not only
nearly three dozen charges against Trump in

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:28.170
this one of three or four major criminal investigations,
but felony charges as well.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:33.620
At least one of them, CBS News, reporting
former President Donald Trump faces a felony

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.620
charge.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.890
A source told CBS News Saturday.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.569
A person familiar with the matter said to
CBS News.

00:02:40.569 --> 00:02:45.860
Trump is being charged with falsifying business
records in the first degree, which is a felony

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.390
in New York state.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:53.110
Now, immediately, the law and order people
coming out and saying it shouldn't be a felony.

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.890
This is part of the problem.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.520
Screw that.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.520
Well.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:01.680
If you're for law and order right now, that's
a felony.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:07.360
And if you are not above the law, if we have
justice, then everyone, regardless of their

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:13.099
position, job, wealth or situation of power,
would be subject to that law.

00:03:13.099 --> 00:03:19.970
But how quickly the law and order people change
their tune when it is all of a sudden inconvenient.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:26.020
There were concerns about violent protests
as a result of Trumpists showing up here or

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.020
there.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:31.989
Now, I don't believe we are yet out of the
woods because there is a protest planned tomorrow

00:03:31.989 --> 00:03:37.819
at noon in New York City involving repugnant
and radical reactionary Republican Congresswoman

00:03:37.819 --> 00:03:39.430
Marjorie Taylor GREENE.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.750
We will talk about that separately.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:48.200
But the good news so far is that the protests
we've seen at Trump Tower in New York City

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.519
and at Mar a Lago have been pathetic.

00:03:50.519 --> 00:03:57.150
A report from Bloomberg News is that at Mar
a Lago, few show up to protest Trump's indictment.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.560
There were a dozen, maybe two dozen people,
quite pathetic.

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:03.379
And honestly, I'm glad.

00:04:03.379 --> 00:04:07.000
I'm glad I don't want there to be violence.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.220
And there was some video from New York City
where I think there was one pro tour, one.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.220
It's not even a protest.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:17.940
It's sort of like a show of support at Trump
Tower where there were one or two people,

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:23.070
not one or two dozen, one or two people, which
