00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.509
Now, many of you have started to write to
me and said, David, you know, we know you're

00:04:26.509 --> 00:04:27.690
going to be away in a little bit.

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:28.690
Are you?

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.199
What's the timeline of this Trump thing?

00:04:30.199 --> 00:04:31.980
Are you going to be around to cover it?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:37.770
The expectation is that, number one, these
things don't move that quickly.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:42.410
And number two, you always want to delay,
delay, delay as much as you can.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:48.000
There's an interesting article called Donald
Trump's Time Tested Legal Strategy Attack

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.220
and DeLay.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:54.960
This article from D-N.Y.. U.S. says these
two tactics have been at the center of Donald

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:59.830
Trump's favored strategy in court cases for
much of his adult life and will likely be

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:04.960
the former president's approach to fighting
the criminal charges now leveled against him.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.610
You want to delay as much as possible, and
many attorneys will tell you there are a whole

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.330
bunch of reasons for this.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:16.720
You can delay with the hopes that those in
charge of prosecuting the case get frustrated,

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:24.400
change jobs, whatever you can delay and delay
and delay with the hopes that witnesses forget

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:28.289
their testimony or they die or whatever the
case may be.

00:05:28.289 --> 00:05:34.500
It is often said by attorneys in many different
areas of criminal law.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:39.250
The longer you can delay actually adjudicating
a case, the better.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:44.760
And so none of listen to the fact that I'll
be away next week shouldn't at all impact

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:50.370
my ability to cover this, because we could
be talking about months if not if not years

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.500
potentially here.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.250
And that is certainly to be expected.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:06:00.889
I am not aware in terms of the defense that
this is all political, that this is all a

